{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d4e5f6a7-b8c9-0123-def0-345678901234",
    "name": "Baby Go — Settings",
    "description": "Configuración global (documento único `settings`).\n\nBase: {{baseUrl}} = http://localhost:3000/api\nRutas: /api/v1/settings\n\n- GET: público (sin token)\n- PATCH: requiere Bearer JWT\n\nEl seeder crea `supportedCountries` al arrancar si no existe el documento.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Settings",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Get settings (público)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/settings",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "settings"]
            },
            "description": "Devuelve el singleton settings (supportedCountries). Sin JWT.\nSi no hay documento → 404 `settings_not_found` (el seeder suele crearlo al boot)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Update settings (JWT)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"supportedCountries\": [\n    { \"code\": \"NL\", \"phoneCode\": \"+31\" },\n    { \"code\": \"ES\", \"phoneCode\": \"+34\" },\n    { \"code\": \"IT\", \"phoneCode\": \"+39\" },\n    { \"code\": \"DE\", \"phoneCode\": \"+49\" },\n    { \"code\": \"BE\", \"phoneCode\": \"+32\" },\n    { \"code\": \"UK\", \"phoneCode\": \"+44\" },\n    { \"code\": \"PT\", \"phoneCode\": \"+351\" },\n    { \"code\": \"FR\", \"phoneCode\": \"+33\" },\n    { \"code\": \"CL\", \"phoneCode\": \"+56\" }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/settings",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "settings"]
            },
            "description": "Actualiza settings (parcial). Requiere Bearer {{token}}.\n`supportedCountries`: array de `{ code, phoneCode }` (phoneCode con `+`).\nSi no existe documento → 404 `settings_not_found`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
